WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.445 --> 00:00:03.735
Unit seventeen. Social Media Balance!

2
00:00:04.859 --> 00:00:10.852
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Vibol. Welcome to Secondary English, Level three!

3
00:00:10.902 --> 00:00:14.077
Hi, Teacher Vibol! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.127 --> 00:00:18.087
Today we learn: Social Media Balance. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.847 --> 00:00:24.264
Social media. Say it with me. Social media!

6
00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:31.503
Screen time. Say it with me. Screen time!

7
00:00:35.018 --> 00:00:38.435
Balance. Say it with me. Balance!

8
00:00:41.888 --> 00:00:45.388
Disconnect. Say it with me. Disconnect!

9
00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:52.581
Real life. Say it with me. Real life!

10
00:00:56.110 --> 00:00:59.560
Addiction. Say it with me. Addiction!

11
00:01:03.043 --> 00:01:06.060
Limit. Say it with me. Limit!

12
00:01:09.557 --> 00:01:13.274
Mindful. Say it with me. Mindful!

13
00:01:16.793 --> 00:01:28.136
Grammar time! It's important to + verb. Listen. It's important to limit screen time. It's important to disconnect sometimes.

14
00:01:28.186 --> 00:01:35.749
Your turn. Say it with me. It's important to limit screen time. It's important to disconnect sometimes.

15
00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:52.307
Finding a healthy balance with social media means being mindful of your screen time. It's important to disconnect sometimes and focus on real life. Setting a limit can help avoid addiction.

16
00:01:52.357 --> 00:01:53.734
I like this story!

17
00:01:55.057 --> 00:02:00.372
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:00.422 --> 00:02:01.572
Balance!

19
00:02:02.599 --> 00:02:07.691
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:07.741 --> 00:02:08.891
Limit!

21
00:02:09.634 --> 00:02:18.580
Think and answer. How do you balance social media with real life activities?

22
00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:19.780
Great answer!

23
00:02:20.925 --> 00:02:23.266
This unit's value is Self-Discipline.

24
00:02:23.316 --> 00:02:26.075
I can show self-discipline every day!

25
00:02:27.521 --> 00:02:32.829
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:32.879 --> 00:02:34.791
Bye-bye, friends!

